Automation is one of the defining characteristics of mature cloud operations. Repetitive administrative tasks should be automated wherever possible to improve consistency and reduce manual effort.

Common automation opportunities include:

* Infrastructure deployment
* Backup scheduling
* Resource cleanup
* Monitoring alerts
* Patch management
* Compliance reporting

# Real-Life Example:
For example, administrators automate the shutdown of development virtual machines outside working hours to reduce operational costs.

# Real-Life Use Case:
A real-life use case is enterprises using automation to manage thousands of Azure resources efficiently.

Automation increases reliability while reducing operational complexity.
